error[T0812] classes.tov:23:3: field `count` is never assigned in the constructor
   23 |   count: int
  why: every field needs a value before the object is used
  instead: assign `this.count = ...` at the top level of the constructor, give it an initializer, or make it optional (`count?: int`)

error[T0813] classes.tov:34:5: `this` is used before every field is assigned
   34 |     this.log()
  unassigned: `b`
  why: methods (and anything `this` is passed to) could read fields that don't have values yet
  instead: assign every field first, then call methods or pass `this`

